{
  "title": "Route Table · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "목적지 주소와 다음 경로 대상을 연결하는 규칙 집합이다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Route Table</span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#destination-and-target\">Destination and Target</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#local-route\">Local Route</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#longest-prefix-match\">Longest Prefix Match</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#main-route-table\">Main Route Table</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#route-propagation\">Route Propagation</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#blackhole-and-asymmetric-routing\">Blackhole and Asymmetric Routing</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>43 / 62</span></div><h1>Route Table</h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 6 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Route Table은 패킷의 Destination과 다음 경로 Target을 매핑한다. 주소 변환이나 방화벽 정책 자체를 정의하는 기능은 아니다.</p><p>Subnet은 하나의 Route Table을 사용하지만 한 Route Table을 여러 Subnet에 연결할 수 있다. 경로 문제를 조사할 때 요청 경로뿐 아니라 응답 경로도 확인해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"Longest Prefix Match\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>Longest Prefix Match</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Specific destination</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>10.0.1.25</strong><small>목적지 주소</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>10.0.1.0/24</strong><small>/16보다 구체적인 경로</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Selected target</strong><small>가장 긴 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a>의 대상</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Other destination</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>8.8.8.8</strong><small>더 구체적인 경로 없음</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong>0.0.0.0/0</strong><small>기본 경로</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a> / <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a></strong><small>Subnet의 설계에 따른 대상</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Route Table은 다음 경로를 정하고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>·<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a>은 허용 여부를 정한다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"destination-and-target\"><h2>Destination and Target<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#destination-and-target\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>Destination에는 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>/IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a> 또는 지원되는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a> List를 사용하고 Target에는 Gateway, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a>, Peering 등이 들어간다. 0.0.0.0/0과 ::/0은 각각 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>와 IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span>의 Default Route다. 둘은 서로 대체되지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"local-route\"><h2>Local Route<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#local-route\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> 내부 주소 범위의 통신을 위한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#local-route\">Local Route</a>가 생성된다. 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#vpc-cidr\">VPC CIDR</a>이 있으면 해당 주소 범위의 경로도 고려한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#local-route\">Local Route</a>가 있어도 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a>이 차단하면 통신하지 못한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"longest-prefix-match\"><h2>Longest Prefix Match<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#longest-prefix-match\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>같은 목적지에 여러 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>이 일치하면 더 긴 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a>가 우선한다. 10.0.0.0/16과 0.0.0.0/0이 모두 일치할 때 /16 경로를 고른다. Default Route가 더 구체적인 서비스·사설 경로를 덮어쓰지 않는다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"main-route-table\"><h2>Main Route Table<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#main-route-table\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>별도 Route Table을 명시적으로 연결하지 않은 Subnet은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#main-route-table\">Main Route Table</a>을 사용한다. Explicit Association으로 원하는 테이블을 지정할 수 있다. Main의 변경은 암묵적으로 연결된 여러 Subnet의 경로를 바꾸므로 영향 범위를 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"route-propagation\"><h2>Route Propagation<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#route-propagation\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN</a> 또는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a> 구성에서 동적으로 학습한 경로를 반영할 수 있다. Propagation을 켜는 것만으로 모든 Network가 연결되는 것은 아니며 Attachment·Association과 보안 정책도 맞아야 한다. 정적 경로와 동적 경로의 우선순위를 서비스 문서에서 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"blackhole-and-asymmetric-routing\"><h2>Blackhole and Asymmetric Routing<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#blackhole-and-asymmetric-routing\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>대상이 삭제되거나 사용 불가능하면 Route가 Blackhole 상태가 될 수 있다. 왕복 트래픽이 서로 다른 Stateful Firewall을 지나면 연결이 끊길 수 있다. 정상 Route 존재, Target 상태, Return Route를 순서대로 조사한다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#private-subnet\">Private Subnet</a>의 기본 Route를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>로 두고 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/#buckets-objects-and-keys\">Prefix</a> List 경로를 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#gateway-endpoint\">Gateway Endpoint</a>로 두면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> 요청은 더 구체적인 Endpoint 경로를 사용한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>퍼블릭 Subnet은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로만으로 완성되지 않는다. 인스턴스의 공인 주소와 허용 규칙도 확인한다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/VPC_Route_Tables.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/userguide/VPC_Route_Tables.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q006/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q006\" data-question=\"Q006\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q006</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q006/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">Which IP address falls within the 10.0.1.0/24 CIDR block?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.2.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">10.1.1.124</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q006\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">10.0.0.124</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · /24는 앞 24비트, 곧 이 예시의 10.0.1이 같아야 한다. AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> 예약 주소 여부도 별도로 확인한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q008\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q009\" data-question=\"Q009\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q009</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q009/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a public subnet must receive requests directly from internet clients. Which combination is required?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Only an S3 gateway endpoint</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a route to a NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A route to an internet gateway, a public address, and permissive security rules</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q009\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Only a private IP address</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">IGW</a>로 향하는 경로와 외부에서 도달할 주소, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">SG</a>/<a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">NACL</a> 허용이 함께 필요하다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eip/\">Elastic IP</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q010\" data-question=\"Q010\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q010</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q010/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An EC2 instance in a private subnet needs outbound IPv4 access to an internet package repository. What is a typical design?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A NAT gateway in a public subnet and a route from the private subnet to it</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach an internet gateway directly to the private subnet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy only CloudFront</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q010\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a Route 53 failover policy</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · 퍼블릭 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>를 통해 외부 연결을 시작하고 응답받는다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q011\" data-question=\"Q011\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q011</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q011/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">An application runs in two Availability Zones and uses zonal public NAT gateways. If one AZ fails, workloads in the surviving AZ must retain outbound internet access. Which NAT design should the architect use?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Add only a network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Use a single NAT gateway in AZ A</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Deploy a NAT gateway in each AZ and route each subnet to its local NAT gateway</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q011\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Attach one Elastic IP to both AZs simultaneously</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>별 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a>와 경로는 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 의존을 제거하고 교차 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> 트래픽도 줄인다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">이전 용어 <b>Route 53</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/dr/\">다음 용어 <b>RPO / RTO</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
